<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115505" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψευδοκλητ-εία</span></b> , ἡ,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλητεύω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the offence of falsely subscribing one's name as
				witness to a summons</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλητήρ</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, γραφὴ
			ψευδοκλητείας</span> a prosecution <i>for such false
				subscription,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				53.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				59.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαδίζειν ἐπί τινα τῆς ψευδοκλητείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					53.15
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψευδοκλητείας τρὶς ὀφλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					1.74
				</span></i>
			.—This is the form found in <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i> l.c. (Pap.), in the best codd. of <i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i> and in <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				8.40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				44
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψευδοκλητία</span></b>  is
			found in codd. of <i><span class="en">
				And.
			</span></i> and as v. l. in <i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψευδοκλησία</span></b>  in <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i> (with vv.ll. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κλητία, -κληστία,
				-κλησις</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
